infographic sequence-ascending-steps
data
  title Concepts: four levels
  desc Read bottom-up. Teal = concepts. Start with vocabulary; add a level when its trigger fires.
  sequences
    - label Vocabulary
      desc One word per concept. Trigger: synonym drift.
      icon book open
    - label Taxonomy
      desc Closed lists. Trigger: agent invents a category.
      icon tags
    - label Ontology
      desc Entities, states, rules. Trigger: agent invents fields.
      icon sitemap
    - label Value stream
      desc Ordered stages, actor, entry and exit states. Trigger: journeys do not compose.
      icon route
  order asc
theme
  palette #0E6B5B #0E6B5B #0E6B5B #0E6B5B
